title: "Arabic Retrieval Starter Kit"
abstract: >-
  A small, fully synthetic Arabic and English retrieval and RAG evaluation
  fixture with graded qrels, superseded-policy hard negatives, and partly
  answerable and unanswerable questions. Written by Bayanat Labs; the company,
  policies and numbers are fictional.
